+# Forms: SOPEXPR 94 99 99 (add/sub/min/max), multiply 94 33 22,
+# multiply with a temp source 94 88 22, SOPMAD 94 93 92, and a literal-
+# operand form (SOPEXPR prefix, log2 constant code in byte 15).
